WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.180 --> 01:30.980
You'd better have a good reason
for calling me out here so late.

01:32.100 --> 01:33.230
I'm sorry...

01:33.550 --> 01:37.230
but there's something I just
had to ask you, Robin!

01:37.230 --> 01:41.740
Believe it or not, I finally managed
to read all of Mama's diary.

01:42.280 --> 01:43.780
Her diary?

01:43.780 --> 01:46.240
Yeah, according to the diary,

01:46.240 --> 01:49.160
Mama left Le Royaume on her own,

01:49.160 --> 01:51.490
to try and quell the fighting
with the Ogres.

01:52.330 --> 01:54.510
So where did your mom go?

01:55.000 --> 01:57.120
She didn't write that.

01:57.710 --> 02:03.470
But it means she could be somewhere in the Human World. Or anywhere, really.

02:04.710 --> 02:05.730
That'd be...

02:06.510 --> 02:08.940
Robin, if you know something,
you have to tell me!

02:09.340 --> 02:11.760
I want the truth!

02:12.760 --> 02:16.310
But no one has seen a trace of
her in the Magical World,

02:16.310 --> 02:18.150
or even heard any rumors.

02:18.690 --> 02:20.740
That can only mean that she's gone.

02:23.690 --> 02:24.530
Mama...

02:26.820 --> 02:30.200
Pierre's Scheme, Vanilla's Heart.

02:37.910 --> 02:39.680
Chocolat-chan...

02:41.420 --> 02:42.040
Vanilla,

02:43.960 --> 02:45.300
how are you feeling?

02:45.800 --> 02:48.170
Better than before, at least.

02:50.220 --> 02:51.340
Back then,

02:51.850 --> 02:54.050
did Chocolat-chan shield us?

02:55.720 --> 02:57.990
I... I...

03:00.150 --> 03:01.490
Vanilla?

03:05.530 --> 03:07.830
Kindness is an insidious poison.

03:08.780 --> 03:11.110
It will be your undoing.

03:14.870 --> 03:16.130
Pierre-sama!

03:17.410 --> 03:18.330
What is it?

03:18.830 --> 03:21.670
It seems that the Moon Door
has been sealed.

03:21.670 --> 03:22.750
What?

03:22.750 --> 03:23.760
The Moon Door?

03:24.290 --> 03:25.550
After last night,

03:25.550 --> 03:28.420
they now know our powers are
a force to be reckoned with.

03:28.420 --> 03:29.340
What an outrage!

03:31.510 --> 03:33.770
They're trying to lock us away!

03:36.180 --> 03:38.220
Did Queen Candy order this?

03:38.890 --> 03:39.810
Most likely.

03:40.310 --> 03:41.520
That person is the only one...

03:41.520 --> 03:45.230
who has the slightest understanding
of what we're about.

03:45.230 --> 03:46.830
So that's their game.

03:49.150 --> 03:50.290
How amusing.

03:51.030 --> 03:53.870
This means they can't stop us...

03:53.870 --> 03:56.290
from collecting all the Noir we
want in the Human World.

03:57.160 --> 04:00.050
Vanilla, can I count on
your cooperation?

04:01.290 --> 04:02.160
Yes.

04:07.420 --> 04:09.390
Good morning, everyone!

04:09.800 --> 04:10.630
Good morning...

04:10.630 --> 04:13.600
Just play along for now,
and come with me!

04:13.600 --> 04:16.430
No thanks, I'm good.

04:16.430 --> 04:17.230
Me too.

04:17.230 --> 04:19.430
Don't be like that, 'kay?

04:19.430 --> 04:20.520
Okay...?

04:20.520 --> 04:21.640
O-kaaay...

04:21.640 --> 04:23.900
Good morning!
Whatcha talking about?

04:23.900 --> 04:26.990
Um, it's guy stuff.

04:27.940 --> 04:29.780
Think it over.

04:31.280 --> 04:32.610
What a weirdo.

04:32.610 --> 04:34.990
Mimura, what was he talking about?

04:34.990 --> 04:37.630
Oh, nothing much, I swear!

04:37.630 --> 04:39.910
If it were, we'd tell you.

04:39.910 --> 04:40.540
Right?

04:40.540 --> 04:41.450
Yeah.

04:41.450 --> 04:42.470
Bye!

04:43.830 --> 04:44.960
What the heck?

04:47.210 --> 04:49.500
I heard it's super fun!

04:50.090 --> 04:51.240
I should go too!

04:51.880 --> 04:53.470
It's going down at lunch today.

04:53.470 --> 04:56.180
As soon as I finish eating, I'm there.

04:56.180 --> 04:58.510
Something's gotten into the boys.

04:59.100 --> 05:01.350
They've been sneaking
around all morning.

05:03.640 --> 05:04.690
Later, then!

05:08.940 --> 05:09.960
Vanilla...

05:27.750 --> 05:28.750
Get a move on!

05:28.750 --> 05:29.380
Yeah!

05:30.550 --> 05:32.590
Where do you think they're going?

05:32.590 --> 05:36.130
Maybe there's a connection to their
conversations this morning?

05:37.890 --> 05:39.890
Something is definitely up.

05:45.140 --> 05:47.810
Yo, Akira, ain't you going?

05:48.560 --> 05:51.650
Oh, you mean the Student Council's
Data Collection Tea Party?

05:51.650 --> 05:52.730
Tea party?

05:53.610 --> 05:55.360
Wha... it's you three?!

05:55.360 --> 05:56.450
Oh crap...

05:56.450 --> 05:59.030
They told me to keep it
a secret from the girls.

05:59.030 --> 06:00.490
What's going on here?

06:00.490 --> 06:02.120
Out with it!

06:02.120 --> 06:04.050
Oh, nothing...

06:04.870 --> 06:06.510
Don't beat around the bush!

06:07.170 --> 06:11.010
It's... Ice asked the boys to come
to the garden behind the school.

06:11.420 --> 06:12.630
Vanilla did?

06:12.630 --> 06:16.770
Yeah. I wasn't gonna go, 'cause
I don't like tea parties...

06:17.430 --> 06:18.680
Ah, Chocolat!

06:18.680 --> 06:19.590
Wait for us!

06:27.350 --> 06:30.700
Step right this way to
Ice-san's tea party!

06:31.060 --> 06:33.820
They're having a tea
party way out here?

06:33.820 --> 06:36.860
I never knew about this
school facility.

06:36.860 --> 06:37.400
Huh?

06:38.280 --> 06:43.280
That boy who was talking to Mimura
and Taiji earlier is guiding them.

06:43.280 --> 06:45.830
He was talking to Vanilla-chan
in the hallway, too.

06:48.580 --> 06:49.390
We're going in.

06:49.390 --> 06:50.370
Yeah.

06:59.880 --> 07:01.640
There's the exit!

07:08.980 --> 07:09.820
Chocolat...

07:11.230 --> 07:12.850
We're back where we started.

07:14.770 --> 07:16.490
We really are...

07:16.750 --> 07:19.080
Gotta be... magic.

07:22.950 --> 07:24.620
Chocolat, what's wrong?

07:25.080 --> 07:26.660
Oh, nothing...

07:28.580 --> 07:29.530
Pierre.

07:35.250 --> 07:38.220
What's Pierre planning?

07:51.060 --> 07:52.900
It smells so good...

07:52.900 --> 07:54.650
Smells like Vanilla~

07:54.650 --> 07:56.990
It smells just like Ice...

07:58.280 --> 08:00.030
It's Ice-san!

08:00.030 --> 08:01.240
It's Vanilla-chan!

08:01.240 --> 08:02.030
Ice-chan!

08:02.030 --> 08:03.780
Va-nil-la-chaaan!

08:06.740 --> 08:10.910
Thank you all for coming
to my tea party today.

08:10.910 --> 08:12.540
You've made me so happy!

08:17.800 --> 08:20.300
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

08:20.300 --> 08:22.850
Hearts, hearts, come to me!

08:28.430 --> 08:30.180
What were we doing here...?

08:30.180 --> 08:31.310
Where the heck are we?

08:33.480 --> 08:35.310
But she's just so cute!

08:35.310 --> 08:37.150
Vanilla-chan's the best!

08:37.610 --> 08:40.320
I've gathered all of you here today...

08:40.320 --> 08:43.490
to find recruits to become
my new Members.

08:44.780 --> 08:46.240
Eh? Members?!

08:46.240 --> 08:47.030
Yes.

08:47.660 --> 08:49.870
I've always wished for people...

08:49.870 --> 08:53.720
who'd always be at my side,
protecting me like knights.

08:54.170 --> 08:56.250
Always at Vanilla-chan's side?

08:56.250 --> 08:57.470
Awesome!

08:57.960 --> 09:00.220
I wonder if any of you...

09:00.220 --> 09:02.560
might be my Prince Charming?

09:03.090 --> 09:04.180
I'm your man!

09:04.180 --> 09:05.230
I'd be perfect for it!

09:05.640 --> 09:07.300
I nominate myself!

09:07.300 --> 09:08.230
So do I, so do I!

09:08.600 --> 09:11.640
I feel like throwing my
hat in the ring too!

09:11.640 --> 09:13.490
I'm running too!

09:14.640 --> 09:16.820
Ah, there's sooo many~

09:16.820 --> 09:19.980
I'd love to have you all,
but I just can't.

09:21.230 --> 09:22.830
So how many?

09:23.530 --> 09:25.070
Let's see...

09:25.070 --> 09:27.460
I'm leaning towards four.

09:28.990 --> 09:30.490
You, drop out!

09:30.490 --> 09:31.460
Why don't YOU?

09:36.120 --> 09:37.170
Vanilla-chan!

09:38.880 --> 09:42.260
Why don't you choose from
among the candidates?

09:42.260 --> 09:44.430
Me, choose? But...

09:45.510 --> 09:47.680
I know it seems impossible now,

09:47.680 --> 09:49.390
so why don't you sleep on it?

09:49.890 --> 09:51.440
Is that acceptable to you all?

09:52.350 --> 09:56.140
It's fine as long as Vanilla-chan
chooses, right?

09:56.140 --> 09:56.700
Yeah.

09:57.310 --> 10:00.020
Okay, then that's what I'll do.

10:00.020 --> 10:02.900
Yasuda-kun, thanks for
your help on this issue,

10:02.900 --> 10:05.740
and the tea party in general.

10:07.740 --> 10:10.920
I'd love to have you as
one of my Members.

10:11.700 --> 10:12.670
Pretty please?

10:15.420 --> 10:17.120
Why just him?

10:17.120 --> 10:17.800
Cheater!

10:17.800 --> 10:19.250
No fair!

10:19.250 --> 10:20.850
Now I'm pissed.

10:22.420 --> 10:24.710
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

10:31.100 --> 10:32.600
Noir, gather to me!

10:48.900 --> 10:50.360
The more...

10:50.360 --> 10:52.840
Noir I collect, the more it hurts.

10:55.700 --> 10:57.950
Your original heart is
attempting to resist.

10:58.620 --> 11:02.130
Once you discard all kindness, the pain will eventually recede.

11:03.630 --> 11:05.600
Collect more Noir.

11:06.260 --> 11:08.550
This is all to escape the pain,

11:08.550 --> 11:11.100
and to control the Human World.

11:12.350 --> 11:13.350
Really?

11:14.600 --> 11:16.140
Huh? Members?

11:16.640 --> 11:18.850
As in Pierre's "Members"?

11:19.390 --> 11:21.110
Yeah, looks like it.

11:21.770 --> 11:26.520
We couldn't get past Pierre's barrier
to find out for ourselves.

11:27.990 --> 11:30.910
We asked Mimura and
Taiji about it later,

11:30.910 --> 11:33.370
and they said Vanilla'd choose...

11:33.370 --> 11:35.870
her Members from the
tea party crowd.

11:35.870 --> 11:37.080
Now I see.

11:37.080 --> 11:39.790
She brought them together so she
could collect their hearts.

11:39.790 --> 11:41.180
Orange, pint, and...

11:41.620 --> 11:42.590
Noir, too?

11:44.250 --> 11:46.590
I wonder if Vanilla can
handle collecting...

11:46.590 --> 11:48.600
any more Noir than she already has.

11:49.970 --> 11:52.100
Ah, that's right!

11:52.510 --> 11:55.390
I found this on the floor in
your room, Chocolat.

11:57.390 --> 12:00.810
It must've fallen out of
your mom's diary.

12:02.400 --> 12:04.190
"To Cinammon:"

12:04.190 --> 12:06.190
"I've moved out to the Cocoa Desert."

12:06.190 --> 12:07.480
"Come visit me sometime."

12:07.480 --> 12:09.690
"We'll discuss the 'issue' at length."

12:09.690 --> 12:10.690
"~Amber."

12:12.360 --> 12:14.240
Who's this Amber person?

12:14.240 --> 12:15.780
The Cocoa Desert?

12:15.780 --> 12:17.380
Never heard of it.

12:18.410 --> 12:19.950
No surprise there.

12:19.950 --> 12:23.130
It's not on any of the Magical
World maps.

12:23.580 --> 12:26.850
Still, why was that letter
stuffed inside the diary?

12:29.550 --> 12:33.680
Hey, this person might know
something about Mama!

12:33.680 --> 12:34.730
What?

12:33.680 --> 12:34.730
Huh?

12:49.400 --> 12:53.520
I just know Robin came
to a party at this hotel.

12:56.240 --> 12:58.410
Robin's somewhere in this crowd?

12:58.410 --> 13:00.290
I can't see him at all.

13:02.200 --> 13:03.080
Over there!

13:06.920 --> 13:08.390
La vie en rose...

13:08.840 --> 13:11.220
I feel like I'll melt as I
look into those eyes...

13:11.710 --> 13:13.840
Ah, is that so?

13:13.840 --> 13:14.850
Sugar coeur...

13:16.010 --> 13:18.550
Just thinking about you leaves
me weak in the knees.

13:18.550 --> 13:19.470
Nooo...

13:20.270 --> 13:23.430
Being surrounded by all you lovely
mademoiselles tonight...

13:23.430 --> 13:25.770
makes me so very happy.

13:26.360 --> 13:28.400
He's so cool!

13:28.900 --> 13:31.650
Now now, who's behind this mischief?

13:33.650 --> 13:35.360
Robin-sama?

13:35.360 --> 13:38.950
Hey! I was just about to get their
hearts, until you got in the way.

13:38.950 --> 13:40.340
Don't get so worked up.

13:40.790 --> 13:43.120
There's something
I want you to see...

13:43.700 --> 13:45.300
and here it is

13:45.960 --> 13:47.630
What do we have here?

13:47.630 --> 13:51.300
It seems like a letter to Mama
from someone called "Amber."

13:52.300 --> 13:53.220
A-Amber?!

13:53.760 --> 13:54.840
You know her?

13:54.840 --> 13:56.470
N-no, I don't.

13:56.470 --> 13:58.510
What about the Cocoa Desert?

13:58.510 --> 14:00.140
Can't say I know the place.

14:00.640 --> 14:02.140
I see...

14:02.140 --> 14:03.990
Congratulations!

14:05.270 --> 14:06.600
Who's that?

14:06.600 --> 14:11.230
He's a celebrated producer who's behind most young singers' songs these days.

14:17.700 --> 14:22.880
I'd like to thank everybody here for
coming to my awards ceremony.

14:22.880 --> 14:27.120
The truth is, I've come across some
rather amazing "raw materials."

14:27.120 --> 14:28.920
And now, I present her to you.

14:32.880 --> 14:34.630
Nice to meet you, everyone!

14:34.630 --> 14:35.470
I'm Vanilla!

14:36.420 --> 14:37.180
Vanilla?

14:37.470 --> 14:38.720
She's so cute!

14:39.640 --> 14:41.260
Everyone, please treat her well.

14:47.390 --> 14:50.190
I'll need Vanilla-chan
to do her very best.

14:50.690 --> 14:53.690
As a fellow Ogre, that is.

15:05.130 --> 15:08.920
A soft gentle wind

15:10.720 --> 15:14.590
rocks a prism to and fro

15:15.800 --> 15:21.300
I stand at the windowsill

15:21.300 --> 15:26.670
and take a deep breath

15:28.520 --> 15:30.980
I never knew Vanilla
could sing like this.

15:30.980 --> 15:32.840
That's not all.

15:33.230 --> 15:36.280
There's a spell cast over
this entire hall.

15:36.280 --> 15:37.330
Pierre's here, too.

15:38.490 --> 15:39.360
Pierre?

15:39.360 --> 15:42.590
How can she sing such
a childish song?

15:43.070 --> 15:47.340
Our singing talents
are far above hers.

15:48.700 --> 15:50.580
They've all got Noir hearts!

15:51.670 --> 15:54.790
If she picks up all these
Noir hearts...

15:54.790 --> 15:57.090
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

15:57.630 --> 15:59.670
Hearts, hearts, come to me!

16:07.430 --> 16:09.350
Noir, gather to me!

16:09.980 --> 16:11.430
Don't do it, Vanilla!

16:19.070 --> 16:19.900
What's going on here?

16:24.410 --> 16:25.160
Chocolat!

16:29.660 --> 16:30.750
Vanilla!

16:33.170 --> 16:35.080
Chocolat-chan, you were here?

16:35.540 --> 16:37.340
Vanilla, this is crazy!

16:37.880 --> 16:40.060
Your body can't take it!

16:40.970 --> 16:43.300
Aren't you just jealous because...

16:43.300 --> 16:45.640
I'm collecting so many
hearts, Chocolat-chan?

16:45.640 --> 16:47.220
I am not...

16:47.220 --> 16:50.600
I'm just worried about your health.

16:53.980 --> 16:55.100
Leave me alone!

16:55.730 --> 16:56.570
Vanilla!

16:59.070 --> 17:00.230
Vanilla...

17:05.670 --> 17:09.370
These four gentlemen will
become my Members.

17:11.040 --> 17:12.090
Darn it!

17:12.090 --> 17:13.670
Why'd she pick them?

17:14.370 --> 17:17.750
Will you four protect
me, as my knights?

17:17.750 --> 17:18.680
Of course!

17:19.040 --> 17:19.880
I'm so happy!

17:25.840 --> 17:28.090
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

17:29.390 --> 17:31.220
Noir, gather to me!

17:49.320 --> 17:51.000
What do you want?

17:51.260 --> 17:53.300
I've got business with Vanilla.

17:53.300 --> 17:54.010
What was that?

17:54.380 --> 17:56.380
Vanilla, I just want to talk.

17:58.880 --> 18:01.010
Vanilla-chan doesn't
want to talk to you.

18:04.380 --> 18:06.510
Hey, you're going too far!

18:06.510 --> 18:09.390
Don't let being chosen as a
Member go to your head!

18:09.390 --> 18:11.760
You're just bitter because
you weren't picked.

18:16.390 --> 18:18.900
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:21.360 --> 18:22.750
Fleur Spirale!

18:29.660 --> 18:30.280
Who's there?

18:31.660 --> 18:32.420
Pierre...

18:32.870 --> 18:35.010
I'd appreciate it if you
didn't get in our way...

18:35.580 --> 18:36.210
Chocolat.

18:46.090 --> 18:47.970
I won't let Vanilla suffer anymore!

18:55.810 --> 18:57.980
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:57.980 --> 18:59.620
Fleur Spirale!

19:03.730 --> 19:05.480
I'm not done yet!

19:05.480 --> 19:07.610
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

19:07.610 --> 19:09.030
Brille Etoile!

19:12.780 --> 19:14.420
Chocolat-chan!

19:17.500 --> 19:18.330
Vanilla!

19:21.960 --> 19:23.580
She has two hearts...

19:28.630 --> 19:29.550
Vanilla!

19:29.550 --> 19:30.380
Stay away!

19:30.380 --> 19:31.050
Wha?

19:44.110 --> 19:46.020
What were we doing, again?

19:46.020 --> 19:47.780
Where's Vanilla-chan?

19:47.780 --> 19:49.440
She was just here...

19:49.440 --> 19:50.990
Vanilla-chan?

19:56.740 --> 20:00.620
Vanilla's behind the increase of Noir
hearts in the Human World?

20:00.620 --> 20:01.290
Yes.

20:01.830 --> 20:05.210
The Ogres are likely attempting to
weaken Le Roayume's power...

20:05.210 --> 20:08.270
by creating more Noir
in the Human World.

20:10.170 --> 20:11.720
With all the other hearts
they've acquired,

20:11.720 --> 20:14.270
they've opened up a large lead over
Chocolat Meilleure in the standings.

20:14.720 --> 20:18.280
At this rate, we will see the
birth of an Ogre Queen.

20:22.480 --> 20:24.530
What? Two hearts?

20:24.530 --> 20:27.540
Yep, and one of them was black.

20:27.860 --> 20:28.860
I see.

20:29.650 --> 20:30.690
So this means...

20:30.690 --> 20:35.040
a Noir heart was implanted
alongside her original one.

20:35.490 --> 20:37.750
The Noir was implanted?

20:38.120 --> 20:38.740
Yes.

20:39.290 --> 20:41.960
So that's why Vanilla's
in so much pain.

20:41.960 --> 20:44.960
Those two hearts must
be battling inside her.

20:44.960 --> 20:47.640
Wow, no wonder her body's
breaking down.

20:47.920 --> 20:51.220
Hey, can't we save Vanilla?

20:51.220 --> 20:53.050
There's got to be a way!

20:58.350 --> 21:01.730
If we can remove the Noir,
she might return to normal.

21:01.730 --> 21:06.160
However, there currently aren't any mages who can do that in the Magical World.

21:07.060 --> 21:08.190
No way...

21:09.400 --> 21:10.410
Vanilla...

21:11.190 --> 21:14.450
If anyone could do it, Amber could...

21:14.910 --> 21:16.700
Eh? "Amber"?

21:16.700 --> 21:19.780
The sender of the letter that
was tucked into the diary!

21:23.580 --> 21:26.250
You're saying she might
know something?

21:26.250 --> 21:28.960
N-no, I was only speaking hypothetically...

21:30.210 --> 21:31.930
I'm gonna go check it out!

21:32.460 --> 21:34.050
Where's the Cocoa Desert?

21:34.050 --> 21:35.690
You know, don't you?

21:36.010 --> 21:37.090
Tell me!

21:39.350 --> 21:43.730
The Cocoa Desert is on the outer
fringes of the Magical World.

21:43.730 --> 21:45.950
It's not the easiest place to reach.

22:06.210 --> 22:08.640
Kindness is an insidious poison.

22:10.000 --> 22:12.040
It will be your undoing.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:46.640 --> 23:50.400
The Cocoa Desert is nothing but cocoa, as far as the eye can see.

23:50.400 --> 23:53.750
We've come here to see the great witch Amber...

23:53.750 --> 23:56.610
...who knows a way
to remove black hearts.

23:56.610 --> 23:59.880
But this is like searching for a needle in a haystack!

24:00.670 --> 24:02.750
Still, I won't give up!

24:02.750 --> 24:05.920
Because I will take Vanilla back from the Ogres, no matter what.

24:06.440 --> 24:08.490
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.490 --> 24:10.490
The Witch of the Cocoa Desert: Amber

24:11.050 --> 24:12.890
Watch it and I won't whup your butt!

24:12.890 --> 24:13.920
Thanks!
